URL: https://github.com/PCRE2Project/pcre2/releases/download/pcre2-10.49/pcre2-10.49.tar.bz2 a1b29c27e5d4389e62a37f43df8fe8bcdcfb5dcd293f517ee6749f7d07bad802
URL: https://github.com/PCRE2Project/pcre2/releases/download/pcre2-10.49/pcre2-10.49.tar.gz 552cb02ad6c166770edba249d5bd654fe4215935cf20b57ad79593bedd2d52a2
Origname: pcre2-10.49
Name: pcre2

    pcre2 10.49.  This is a security release that fixes an out-of-bounds write

    when using a growable JIT stack (GHSA-r9hj-j2rw-4q3m).  The library itself

    needs no Fil-C changes; the patch only carries over the 10.48 test-suite

    fixes: the RunGrepTest locale.bad test assumes that the locale binary is

    absent, and the RunGrepTest script callout tests fail due to the pcre2grep

    libtool wrapper injecting LD_LIBRARY_PATH.  This used to be consumed as the

    legacy source tree projects/pcre2-10.48 and as the pizlix/pcre2-10.48.tar.bz2

    tarball; it is now a URL-based projeny project so that the pizlix tarball

    convention can be retired for it.
